"app.instructions" = "1. Move NewFile to Applications and enable the Finder extension.\n\n2. Allow NewFile in Accessibility to rename files in Finder.\n\n3. Right-click in a Finder folder and choose “%@”. The file is created immediately, with its name selected for renaming.\n\nChoose the default template in Settings. A number is added if the name is taken; existing files are preserved.";
